Package: lczexplore
Title:  Imports, Visualizes, Compares and Explores Maps of Local Climate Zones
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Matthieu", family = "Gousseff", email =  "matthieu.gousseff@cnrs.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(affiliation = "Centre National de la Recherche Scientifique, Lab-STICC", ORCID = "0000-0002-7106-2677"))
Description: Easily import and visualize local climate zone maps with standard encoding.
    Compare two or more maps, and group some LCZ types according.
    Explore their differences through circular visualization and indicators.
